```mermaid
flowchart TD
    %% Edge + ingress
    U[Users/Clients] -->|HTTPS| FD[Azure Front Door + WAF]
    FD --> APIM[API Management]
    APIM --> CAI[Container Apps Ingress]

    %% Compute
    subgraph CAE[Container Apps Environment]
        GW[gateway/nginx]
        AS[appointment-service]
        AV[availability-service]
        NS[notification-service]
    end
    CAI --> GW
    GW --> AS
    GW --> AV
    GW --> NS

    %% Data plane
    subgraph Data[Data Stores]
        PG[(Postgres Flexible Server<br/>Zone redundant)]
        REDIS[(Azure Cache for Redis Premium)]
        SEARCH[(Cognitive Search/Elastic Cloud)]
        LA[(Log Analytics / Storage)]
    end
    AS <-->|SQL/Transactions| PG
    AV -->|Reads| PG
    AS <-->|Cache/Holds/Idempotency| REDIS
    AV <-->|Cache Availability| REDIS
    AS -->|Index providers| SEARCH
    GW -->|Access Logs| LA

    %% Events
    subgraph Events[Messaging/Eventing]
        SB[Service Bus Topics/Queues]
        EG[Event Grid]
    end
    AS --> SB
    SB --> NS
    EG -->|Audit/Archival| LA

    %% Observability & secrets
    AS -->|Logs/Metrics| LA
    AV -->|Logs/Metrics| LA
    NS -->|Logs/Metrics| LA
    GW -->|Logs/Metrics| LA
    CAE -.->|Managed Identity| MI[Managed Identity]
    CAE -.->|Secrets/Config| KV[Key Vault]
```
